[32m+[m[32mExternal Recruitment System[m
[32m+[m[32m````[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe application combines Salesforce declarative features with programmatic development.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Main Users[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe system is designed around the following users:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Students[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStudents can:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Maintain their profile[m
[32m+[m[32m* View eligible jobs[m
[32m+[m[32m* Apply for jobs[m
[32m+[m[32m* View their applications[m
[32m+[m[32m* Track application status[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Placement Officers[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPlacement officers can:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Manage students[m
[32m+[m[32m* Manage job opportunities[m
[32m+[m[32m* Review applications[m
[32m+[m[32m* Update application status[m
[32m+[m[32m* Monitor placement processing[m
[32m+[m[32m* Monitor external integration status[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Main Salesforce Objects[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Student[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStores student information such as:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Student Name[m
[32m+[m[32m* Email[m
[32m+[m[32m* Branch[m
[32m+[m[32m* CGPA[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Job[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStores available placement opportunities.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mImportant fields include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Job Name[m
[32m+[m[32m* Company[m
[32m+[m[32m* Minimum CGPA[m
[32m+[m[32m* Last Date[m
[32m+[m[32m* Placement Officer Email[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Application[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRepresents a student's application for a particular job.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mImportant fields include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Student[m
[32m+[m[32m* Job[m
[32m+[m[32m* Status[m
[32m+[m[32m* Application Date[m
[32m+[m[32m* Selection Date[m
[32m+[m[32m* Integration Status[m
[32m+[m[32m* External Candidate Id[m
[32m+[m[32m* Last Integration Time[m
[32m+[m[32m* Integration Error[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Offer Letter[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStores offer-related information for students who progress through the placement process.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Main Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Student Management[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStudent records can be created and updated through the Student Profile Lightning Web Component.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe component uses Lightning Data Service / UI Record API operations for:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Create[m
[32m+[m[32m* Read[m
[32m+[m[32m* Update[m
[32m+[m[32m* Delete[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Eligible Jobs[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStudents can select a student profile and view jobs that match the student's eligibility criteria.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEligibility can be based on information such as:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* CGPA[m
[32m+[m[32m* Application deadline[m
[32m+[m[32m* Job requirements[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Job Application[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStudents can apply for available jobs directly from the Lightning Web Component interface.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mApplications are stored in `Application__c` and connected to:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mStudent__c[m
[32m+[m[32mJob__c[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### My Applications[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStudents can view the applications they have submitted and track their current application status.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Application Processing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mApplications move through the placement process using Salesforce automation.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA key status used in the current application flow is:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mApplied[m
[32m+[m[32m↓[m
[32m+[m[32mShortlisted[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe system keeps the business application status separate from the external integration status.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Lightning Web Components[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project contains reusable Lightning Web Components including:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mapplicationCard[m
[32m+[m[32meligibleJobs[m
[32m+[m[32memptyState[m
[32m+[m[32mjobCard[m
[32m+[m[32mmyApplications[m
[32m+[m[32mplacementHome[m
[32m+[m[32mstatusBadge[m
[32m+[m[32mstudentProfile[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe components follow a reusable parent-child architecture where appropriate.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFor example:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mEligible Jobs[m
[32m+[m[32m     ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mJob Card[m
[32m+[m[32m     ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mApply Event[m
[32m+[m[32m     ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mParent Component[m
[32m+[m[32m     ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mApplication Processing[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis keeps individual components focused on specific responsibilities.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Apex[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mApex is used where the application requires server-side processing and business logic.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project contains Apex classes supporting:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Application processing[m
[32m+[m[32m* Asynchronous processing[m
[32m+[m[32m* External API communication[m
[32m+[m[32m* Candidate synchronization[m
[32m+[m[32m* Testing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Asynchronous Processing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe system uses asynchronous Apex for operations that should not block the user's immediate Salesforce transaction.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project includes patterns such as:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Queueable Apex[m
[32m+[m[32m* Other asynchronous processing used during the training project[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe candidate synchronization specifically uses:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mCandidateSyncQueueable[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mwhich implements:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```apex[m
[32m+[m[32mQueueable[m
[32m+[m[32mDatabase.AllowsCallouts[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## External Recruitment Integration[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe Placement Management System communicates with an external recruitment system using a REST API.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe integration flow is:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mApplication[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mShortlisted[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mCandidateSyncQueueable[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mBuild Candidate JSON[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mNamed Credential[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mPOST /candidates[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mExternal Recruitment API[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mProcess Response[m
[32m+[m[32m    ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mUpdate Integration Status[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe candidate payload contains information obtained from the related Student, Job and Application records.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Integration Tracking[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe Application object contains dedicated fields for tracking external synchronization.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Integration Status[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mIntegration_Status__c[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTracks the state of the external synchronization.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mExamples include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mSent[m
[32m+[m[32mFailed[m
[32m+[m[32mRetry Required[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### External Candidate Id[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mExternal_Candidate_Id__c[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStores the candidate identifier returned by the external recruitment system when available.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Last Integration Time[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mLast_Integration_Time__c[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStores the latest integration attempt time.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Integration Error[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mIntegration_Error__c[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStores information about integration failures.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis allows Salesforce users to distinguish between:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mBusiness Status[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mand:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mIntegration Status[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Error Handling[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe integration handles different types of HTTP responses.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m2xx[m
[32m+[m[32m↓[m
[32m+[m[32mSuccess / Sent[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m400[m
[32m+[m[32m↓[m
[32m+[m[32mFailed[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m401[m
[32m+[m[32m↓[m
[32m+[m[32mAuthentication Failure[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m403[m
[32m+[m[32m↓[m
[32m+[m[32mForbidden[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m500–599[m
[32m+[m[32m↓[m
[32m+[m[32mRetry Required[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTemporary external failures are recorded rather than silently ignored.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDuring development and testing, the external recruitment endpoint returned errors such as `503 Service Temporarily Unavailable`. The system recorded these failures as `Retry Required` and stored the error information in `Integration_Error__c`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe external endpoint supplied for the training exercise was not consistently available for successful candidate creation, so successful external candidate creation cannot be represented as a guaranteed production integration.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Named Credential[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe external API is accessed through a Salesforce Named Credential.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mApex uses:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mcallout:Recruitment_API/candidates[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32minstead of hard-coding the external endpoint and authentication information directly into Apex.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis keeps integration configuration separate from application logic.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Idempotency[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCandidate synchronization includes protection against sending an application again after it has already been successfully synchronized.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe Queueable checks the integration status before processing:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mIntegration Status = Sent[m
[32m+[m[32m        ↓[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not send again[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis helps prevent duplicate candidate submissions during repeated processing.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Testing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project contains Apex tests for the candidate synchronization logic.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mImportant test scenarios include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Successful candidate synchronization[m
[32m+[m[32m* Server error handling[m
[32m+[m[32m* Retry-required behaviour[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mQueueable execution can also be verified through Salesforce's asynchronous job records.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mExample:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```sql[m
[32m+[m[32mSELECT Id, Status, JobType, ApexClass.Name[m
[32m+[m[32mFROM AsyncApexJob[m
[32m+[m[32mWHERE JobType = 'Queueable'[m
[32m+[m[32mORDER BY CreatedDate DESC[m
[32m+[m[32mLIMIT 5[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIntegration tracking can be verified using:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```sql[m
[32m+[m[32mSELECT[m
[32m+[m[32m    Id,[m
[32m+[m[32m    Status__c,[m
[32m+[m[32m    Integration_Status__c,[m
[32m+[m[32m    External_Candidate_Id__c,[m
[32m+[m[32m    Last_Integration_Time__c,[m
[32m+[m[32m    Integration_Error__c[m
[32m+[m[32mFROM Application__c[m
[32m+[m[32mORDER BY CreatedDate DESC[m
[32m+[m[32mLIMIT 5[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
